{"id":"5738","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5738_main_altocumulus-castellanus-duplicatus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在本图中，夕阳映照着三层高积云。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">粉色的最下层</span>有从共同云底的云素中突起的小角塔（堡状云种）。在同一云底还有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状高积云簇</span>；这些云簇是从云底已消散的堡状云发展而成。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">第二层</span>就在最下层的上方，并进一步向西延伸。其西边缘正开始变红；太阳还不够低，没有在其底面映出色彩。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">最上层</span>较薄，比其它两层范围更大，可归类为透光成层高积云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，阿斯彭代尔花园VIC 3195","latitude":"纬度: 38° 1' 30'' S","longitude":"经度: 145° 6' 57'' E","date":"28 December 2016 2047 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 8, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.10"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5738_syn_altocumulus-castellanus-duplicatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>低压系统及伴随的低压槽正在向东抵近。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦 2016，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5738_upper_altocumulus-castellanus-duplicatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测显示出从近地面到680 hPa的干绝热直减率。两个较低云层的范围从730 - 700 hPa，而最高层则位于644 hPa。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5834_main_altocumulus-stratifromis-translucidus-perlucidus-duplicatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这两个云片均为高积云属。规则排列的云素为一臂距离的1-3指宽。这对于层积云过小，而对于卷积云过大。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上层云片</span>的浅阴影以及<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">下层云片</span>的深阴影也表明它不是卷积云，而卷积云肯定无任何阴影。</p>\n<p>云片整体很薄，可看到太阳的位置（透光云类），且这两个云片在云素之间有清晰的小空隙（漏隙云类）。在上层云片中，透过这些空隙可看到蓝天，而在下层云片中，可判别出浅灰色的上层云片。</p>\n<p>在地平线的中间可看到这两个云片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">重叠</span>。</p>\n<p>由于这两个云片在后退，因此其编码为CM=7；在左下方可看到消散的边缘。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kam Hoo Man","location":"中国，香港，元朗","latitude":"纬度: 22° 26' 40'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 1' 20'' E","date":"23 November 2013 1021 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 7, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.10 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.10 1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/6083_main_altocumulus-lenticularis-and-rotor-clouds_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>图为焚风事件期间安第斯山脉背风坡的地形云。照片的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中间</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右侧</span>的凸出部分是荚状波状高积云。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">可看到多个波层</span>，表明是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">复云类</span>。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">地形卷云</span>在上方形成。一行<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云可能已在滚轴上形成</span>，它是沿水平轴旋转的空气涡旋。在照片左侧是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>云堤。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Maximiliano Viale","location":"阿根廷，内乌肯，El Cholar","latitude":"纬度: 37° 26' 35'' S","longitude":"经度: 70° 38' 31'' W","date":"31 October 2016 0514 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= 4, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.3"}]}]}